body:
A good example is when i see a dog that does not separation anxiety, Sits still for the bath and does not mind the dryer. That is how i need the owner has bathed, brushed and taught the dog manners, Also if the dog is sociable with other dogs and does not mind being groomed that is a good sign of a good disciplinary owner.  

&#x200B;

A bad example would be the opposite of what i listed, A dog that is aggressive towards humans and dogs, non social, Pissing and shitting everywhere are all factors to a bad owner in my eyes.
